(7205828, 1108928, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your post in the forum the other day about one vs plural makes a lot more sense now.<br/> <br/>Just like an April fool''s joke, you can take this DQ as a bad thing, or you can laugh. I say laugh, because it''s absurd. The whole challenge was a joke, and unfortunately you were tricked by the description. I''ve always secretly pined for a DQ myself. DQs get soooo many more views! You already have almost double what the 10th place has. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Your post in the forum the other day about one vs plural makes a lot more sense now. Just like an April fool''s joke, you can take this DQ as a bad thing, or you can laugh. I say laugh, because it''s absurd. The whole challenge was a joke, and unfortunately you were tricked by the description. I''ve always secretly pined for a DQ myself. DQs get soooo many more views! You already have almost double what the 10th place has.  ', '2014-04-20 14:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
